{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16249901909616649285,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "EEVDF Scheduler",
      "source_hash": 16071342931423889433,
      "context_hash": 9459872502878704244,
      "translation": "EEVDF 스케줄러",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811219Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First: adding latency guarantees to fairness",
      "source_hash": 17955415174129833162,
      "context_hash": 16138773761495407203,
      "translation": "Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First: 공정성에 지연 시간 보장 더하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem with CFS",
      "source_hash": 7571414685463412615,
      "context_hash": 3481657988695606231,
      "translation": "CFS의 문제점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "CFS selects the task with the smallest `vruntime`.",
      "source_hash": 17916186329618669879,
      "context_hash": 16622601724506971161,
      "translation": "CFS는 `vruntime`이 가장 작은 태스크를 선택합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is fair but not deadline-aware.",
      "source_hash": 343485696595787313,
      "context_hash": 8173415315170468539,
      "translation": "이 방식은 공정하지만 데드라인을 고려하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Consider a task that just woke from I/O.",
      "source_hash": 11124240743880957097,
      "context_hash": 2708233385571915300,
      "translation": "I/O에서 막 깨어난 태스크를 생각해 보십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Its vruntime may be behind the pack, so it runs quickly — but CFS has no concept of *urgency*.",
      "source_hash": 4036190502073962495,
      "context_hash": 583942979828739359,
      "translation": "이 태스크의 vruntime은 다른 태스크들보다 뒤처져 있을 수 있으므로 빠르게 실행되지만, CFS에는 *긴급성*이라는 개념이 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS",
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "A task processing a network packet that needs a 1ms response has the same scheduling priority as a batch task that just happened to sleep briefly.",
      "source_hash": 13203053174588656133,
      "context_hash": 9143150752059259197,
      "translation": "1ms 이내의 응답이 필요한 네트워크 패킷을 처리하는 태스크도 우연히 잠시 잠들었던 배치 태스크와 동일한 스케줄링 우선순위를 갖습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811220Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "EEVDF fixes this by replacing CFS's \"minimum vruntime\" selection with **\"earliest deadline among eligible tasks\"**.",
      "source_hash": 17451009010624652932,
      "context_hash": 3061876192530553674,
      "translation": "EEVDF는 CFS의 \"최소 vruntime\" 선택 방식을 **\"실행 자격이 있는 태스크 중 가장 이른 데드라인\"** 선택 방식으로 대체하여 이 문제를 해결합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS",
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Background",
      "source_hash": 14089390735911585672,
      "context_hash": 18210901085328136777,
      "translation": "배경",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "EEVDF is based on the 1995 technical report [\"Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First: A Flexible and Accurate Mechanism for Proportional Share Resource Allocation\"](https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/document?repid=rep1&type=pdf&doi=805acf7726282721504c8f00575d91ebfd750564) by Ion Stoica and Hussein Abdel-Wahab (William & Mary).",
      "source_hash": 14142612699817167968,
      "context_hash": 8100680483982129146,
      "translation": "EEVDF는 Ion Stoica와 Hussein Abdel-Wahab(William & Mary)이 1995년에 발표한 기술 보고서 [\"Earliest Eligible Virtual Deadline First: A Flexible and Accurate Mechanism for Proportional Share Resource Allocation\"](https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/document?repid=rep1&type=pdf&doi=805acf7726282721504c8f00575d91ebfd750564)에 기반합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "It was implemented for Linux by Peter Zijlstra (Intel) and merged in kernel 6.6 (October 2023). **Patch series**: [lore.kernel.org, May 2023](https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20230531115839.089944915@infradead.org/)",
      "source_hash": 4164286194500898318,
      "context_hash": 10594140701875713496,
      "translation": "Peter Zijlstra(Intel)가 Linux용으로 구현했으며 커널 6.6(2023년 10월)에 병합되었습니다. **패치 시리즈**: [lore.kernel.org, 2023년 5월](https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20230531115839.089944915@infradead.org/)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Intel": "Intel",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "patch series": "패치 시리즈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Commits**:",
      "source_hash": 8352024790201054203,
      "context_hash": 17358778843673505957,
      "translation": "**커밋**:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[`147f3efaa241`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/147f3efaa24182a21706bca15eab2f3f4630b5fe) — `sched/fair: Implement an EEVDF-like scheduling algorithm`",
      "source_hash": 7139632851840346520,
      "context_hash": 11290004628451188925,
      "translation": "[`147f3efaa241`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/147f3efaa24182a21706bca15eab2f3f4630b5fe) — `sched/fair: Implement an EEVDF-like scheduling algorithm`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "[`5e963f2bd465`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/5e963f2bd4654a202a8a05aa3a86cb0300b10e6c) — `sched/fair: Commit to EEVDF` (makes EEVDF unconditional in `pick_next_entity`)",
      "source_hash": 16046837520477080806,
      "context_hash": 7812826501687130561,
      "translation": "[`5e963f2bd465`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/5e963f2bd4654a202a8a05aa3a86cb0300b10e6c) — `sched/fair: Commit to EEVDF` (`pick_next_entity`에서 EEVDF를 무조건 사용하도록 함)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Two concepts: eligibility and virtual deadline",
      "source_hash": 11592260845933413160,
      "context_hash": 2099007487160534990,
      "translation": "두 가지 개념: 실행 자격(eligibility)과 가상 데드라인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Eligibility",
      "source_hash": 1311837417089874418,
      "context_hash": 18111425684757183809,
      "translation": "실행 자격",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A task is **eligible** if it hasn't consumed more than its fair share of CPU up to the current virtual time.",
      "source_hash": 2709611894178071369,
      "context_hash": 16661304540929624420,
      "translation": "현재 가상 시간까지 자신의 공정한 몫보다 많은 CPU를 소비하지 않은 태스크는 **실행 자격이 있습니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811221Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Informally: a task that has been running too much is ineligible and shouldn't preempt others.",
      "source_hash": 16050848160765638098,
      "context_hash": 4838076352288741075,
      "translation": "쉽게 말하면, 너무 많이 실행된 태스크는 실행 자격이 없으며 다른 태스크를 선점해서는 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "A task is eligible if its `vruntime` is at or behind the weighted average vruntime of the runqueue.",
      "source_hash": 17287666606147341148,
      "context_hash": 2600798343034797553,
      "translation": "태스크의 `vruntime`이 런큐의 가중 평균 vruntime과 같거나 그보다 뒤처져 있으면 해당 태스크는 실행 자격이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runqueue": "런큐",
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Virtual deadline",
      "source_hash": 288037140912310365,
      "context_hash": 6980957806117594164,
      "translation": "가상 데드라인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Each task has a `deadline` — the virtual time by which it should have run.",
      "source_hash": 8628023457985742655,
      "context_hash": 17709275297606786821,
      "translation": "각 태스크에는 `deadline`, 즉 그 시점까지 실행되었어야 하는 가상 시간이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "When a task is placed on the runqueue, its deadline is set as:",
      "source_hash": 13465929215102653885,
      "context_hash": 16955774595886134129,
      "translation": "태스크가 런큐에 배치될 때 데드라인은 다음과 같이 설정됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "runqueue": "런큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "This means: \"I want to run for `slice` worth of virtual time starting from my current vruntime.\" The deadline is the end of that window.",
      "source_hash": 3883666367085715556,
      "context_hash": 11888663331880807932,
      "translation": "이는 \"현재 vruntime부터 시작하여 `slice`만큼의 가상 시간 동안 실행되고 싶다\"는 의미입니다. 데드라인은 그 구간의 끝입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "A task with a short `slice` gets an early deadline and runs sooner.",
      "source_hash": 14006222645774065122,
      "context_hash": 12945370543487201633,
      "translation": "`slice`가 짧은 태스크는 이른 데드라인을 받아 더 빨리 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "A task with a long `slice` gets a later deadline and may wait.",
      "source_hash": 9365152674048738435,
      "context_hash": 6606824099094871744,
      "translation": "`slice`가 긴 태스크는 더 늦은 데드라인을 받아 대기할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The new fields in sched_entity",
      "source_hash": 4940108640394628946,
      "context_hash": 7753133148504478855,
      "translation": "sched_entity의 새 필드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811222Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "EEVDF added several fields to `struct sched_entity` (in `include/linux/sched.h`):",
      "source_hash": 18228899322901074176,
      "context_hash": 5562676089215965475,
      "translation": "EEVDF는 `struct sched_entity`(`include/linux/sched.h`에 정의됨)에 여러 필드를 추가했습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811223Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "vlag",
      "source_hash": 4897558842540324872,
      "context_hash": 5015613114035578163,
      "translation": "vlag",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811223Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`vlag` tracks the task's lag relative to the ideal fair-share schedule.",
      "source_hash": 2993008416973097532,
      "context_hash": 12394087635802616231,
      "translation": "`vlag`는 이상적인 공정 분배 스케줄 대비 태스크의 지연(lag)을 추적합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811223Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Positive lag means the task is behind its ideal share (hasn't gotten enough CPU); negative lag means it's ahead.",
      "source_hash": 17112244198618795639,
      "context_hash": 4675480908946007847,
      "translation": "lag가 양수이면 태스크가 이상적인 몫보다 뒤처져 있음(CPU를 충분히 받지 못함)을 의미하고, 음수이면 앞서 있음을 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811223Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "When a task wakes up, `vlag` is used to place its `vruntime` appropriately — preventing sleeping tasks from either starving (getting nothing) or bursting (monopolizing CPU after a long sleep).",
      "source_hash": 8262537779819716054,
      "context_hash": 16863624775809330919,
      "translation": "태스크가 깨어날 때 `vlag`를 사용하여 해당 태스크의 `vruntime`을 적절히 배치합니다. 이를 통해 잠들어 있던 태스크가 기아 상태에 빠지거나(아무것도 받지 못함) 폭주하는(오래 잠든 뒤 CPU를 독점함) 것을 방지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:06.811223Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Selection: __pick_eevdf()",
      "source_hash": 4014476358713057267,
      "context_hash": 129964877086616187,
      "translation": "선택: __pick_eevdf()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028653Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The core selection function:",
      "source_hash": 1370605596455236192,
      "context_hash": 13949784928198282653,
      "translation": "핵심 선택 함수:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "function": "함수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028654Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The algorithm walks the RB-tree, finds all eligible tasks, and returns the one with the earliest (smallest) deadline.",
      "source_hash": 15016954531244731815,
      "context_hash": 3111041896990889610,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘은 RB-tree를 순회하며 eligible한 태스크를 모두 찾고, 그중 deadline이 가장 이른(가장 작은) 태스크를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028655Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Non-eligible tasks are skipped.",
      "source_hash": 17652465693099471421,
      "context_hash": 12647278720273908357,
      "translation": "eligible하지 않은 태스크는 건너뜁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The tree traversal is pruned using cached `min_deadline` subtree values for efficiency.",
      "source_hash": 18161500664607188898,
      "context_hash": 7977835507564314202,
      "translation": "효율을 위해 캐시된 서브트리 `min_deadline` 값을 사용하여 트리 순회를 가지치기합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "How EEVDF improves latency",
      "source_hash": 1890044901019742392,
      "context_hash": 3149797251839192757,
      "translation": "EEVDF가 지연 시간을 개선하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
