      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "With CFS (simplified):",
      "source_hash": 1079917161265176086,
      "context_hash": 9005753358419514917,
      "translation": "CFS의 경우(단순화):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CFS": "CFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "With EEVDF:",
      "source_hash": 10678184473262709477,
      "context_hash": 2822061662629844007,
      "translation": "EEVDF의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028659Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The network task has an early deadline (small requested slice) and is eligible (just woke).",
      "source_hash": 6898149384088091505,
      "context_hash": 16638653195966495436,
      "translation": "네트워크 태스크는 deadline이 이르고(요청한 slice가 작음) eligible합니다(방금 깨어남).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "EEVDF schedules it immediately without waiting for vruntime to drift.",
      "source_hash": 12866222996124032925,
      "context_hash": 11121717472123808590,
      "translation": "EEVDF는 vruntime이 변하기를 기다리지 않고 이 태스크를 즉시 스케줄합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "vruntime": "vruntime"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Time slice and sched_base_slice_ns",
      "source_hash": 7579102466784136557,
      "context_hash": 10140131060956309692,
      "translation": "타임 슬라이스와 sched_base_slice_ns",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When EEVDF was merged in 6.6, the old `sched_latency_ns` / `sched_min_granularity_ns` tunables were deprecated in favor of `sched_base_slice_ns` ([`e4ec3318a17f`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/e4ec3318a17f5dcf11bc23b2d2c1da4c1c5bb507), Peter Zijlstra); the sysctls still exist but `sched_base_slice_ns` is now the primary knob.",
      "source_hash": 12665028505275895764,
      "context_hash": 11730410788276746834,
      "translation": "6.6에서 EEVDF가 병합되면서 기존의 `sched_latency_ns` / `sched_min_granularity_ns` 튜너블은 `sched_base_slice_ns`로 대체되어 폐기 예정(deprecated)이 되었습니다([`e4ec3318a17f`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/e4ec3318a17f5dcf11bc23b2d2c1da4c1c5bb507), Peter Zijlstra). 해당 sysctl은 여전히 존재하지만 이제는 `sched_base_slice_ns`가 주된 조절 항목입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "EEVDF": "EEVDF",
        "sysctls": "sysctl"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The base time slice is now controlled by a single knob:",
      "source_hash": 9262993818462083106,
      "context_hash": 3247870402439484036,
      "translation": "이제 기본 타임 슬라이스는 단일 조절 항목으로 제어됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028662Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Each task's `slice` is set to `sched_base_slice_ns` scaled by the task's weight relative to the average.",
      "source_hash": 5071919673960896779,
      "context_hash": 12891569060146472108,
      "translation": "각 태스크의 `slice`는 평균 대비 해당 태스크의 가중치에 따라 조정된 `sched_base_slice_ns` 값으로 설정됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Tasks with larger requested slices get later deadlines; tasks with smaller slices get earlier deadlines and lower latency.",
      "source_hash": 1226560574169956240,
      "context_hash": 8936324536640010434,
      "translation": "요청한 slice가 큰 태스크는 deadline이 늦어지고, slice가 작은 태스크는 deadline이 이르며 지연 시간이 짧아집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028663Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Applications can request a specific latency hint via `sched_setattr()` with `SCHED_FLAG_UTIL_CLAMP_MIN`/`SCHED_FLAG_UTIL_CLAMP_MAX` for frequency scaling, but direct slice control from userspace is not yet exposed.",
      "source_hash": 12299215728835935740,
      "context_hash": 976673830776589536,
      "translation": "애플리케이션은 주파수 스케일링을 위해 `SCHED_FLAG_UTIL_CLAMP_MIN`/`SCHED_FLAG_UTIL_CLAMP_MAX`와 함께 `sched_setattr()`을 사용하여 특정 지연 시간 힌트를 요청할 수 있지만, 사용자 공간에서 slice를 직접 제어하는 기능은 아직 제공되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:02:05.028664Z",
      "issues": []
    },
